        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-DLW5012CRGDBR, 12 Inch Ornate Delaware Refrigerator Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12 Inch Ornate Appliance Pull has a traditional feel that makes it a great choice for classically styled homes. It is available in a wide array of finishes, so you'll be able to match the existing hardware in your kitchen. This Delaware Refrigerator Handle can also be used on the freezer and on the dishwasher too. It is made in the USA and will last for many years to come due to the excellent quality and craftsmanship.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW05-specifications.gif?v=1704354720\" width=\"420\" height=\"290\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions AP-DLW5012CRGDBR Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Delaware 5 Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12.03\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 9.26\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.46\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.26\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 1.02\"</li>\r\n<li>These appliance pulls are supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4\" - 1\" thick panels (standard appliance panel thickness).</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW05-specifications.pdf?v=1704262233\"><b>First Impressions AP-DLW5012CRGDBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
