                "title": "12 Inch Ornate Appliance Pull",
                "description": "The 12 Inch Ornate Appliance Pull has a traditional feel that makes it a great choice for classically styled homes. It is available in a wide array of finishes, so you'll be able to match the existing hardware in your kitchen. This Delaware Refrigerator Handle can also be used on the freezer and on the dishwasher too. It is made in the USA and will last for many years to come due to the excellent quality and craftsmanship.\r\n",
